LETTER k CAPH.-Eleventh Division 

Verse 81. My soul fainteth for thy salvation] I have longed so incessantly after thy salvation-the complete purification and restoration of my soul, that my very spirits are exhausted.  



      "My heartstrings groan with deep complaint; 
         My soul lies panting, Lord, for thee; 
       And every limb and every joint 
         Stretches for perfect purity."
